{"header":"<h1>Module type <code><span>Memory.BUFFER</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Spoc_core","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Memory","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"BUFFER","href":"#","kind":"module-type"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>A buffer packages backend-specific buffer with its operations. All transfers use raw pointers with byte sizes to avoid type parameter escaping issues in first-class modules.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-device\"><a href=\"#val-device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> device : <a href=\"../../Device/index.html#type-t\">Device.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The device this buffer is allocated on</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-size\"><a href=\"#val-size\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> size : int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Number of elements</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-elem_size\"><a href=\"#val-elem_size\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> elem_size : int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Size of each element in bytes</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-device_ptr\"><a href=\"#val-device_ptr\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> device_ptr : nativeint</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Get raw device pointer (for kernel arg binding)</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-host_link\"><a href=\"#val-host_link\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> host_link : <a href=\"../index.html#type-host_link\">host_link</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Relation to the vector's host storage.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-host_ptr_to_device\"><a href=\"#val-host_ptr_to_device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> host_ptr_to_device : <span><span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Transfer from host pointer to device</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-device_to_host_ptr\"><a href=\"#val-device_to_host_ptr\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> device_to_host_ptr : <span><span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Transfer from device to host pointer</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-bind_to_kargs\"><a href=\"#val-bind_to_kargs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> bind_to_kargs : <span><a href=\"../../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-kargs\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.kargs</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Bind this buffer to kernel args at given index</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-range_from_host\"><a href=\"#val-range_from_host\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> range_from_host : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_ptr</span>:nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_offset</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">stream</span>:<span><a href=\"../../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-stream_ref\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.stream_ref</a> option</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Ranged host-&gt;device copy into this buffer at <code>dst_offset</code> bytes. <code>~stream:None</code> is synchronous; <code>Some r</code> enqueues on the stream <code>r</code> unwraps to (refused if it belongs to another backend). <code>src_ptr</code> is not a GC root: the caller keeps it alive until the copy has completed. Backends without ranged copies raise <code>Feature_not_supported</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-range_to_host\"><a href=\"#val-range_to_host\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> range_to_host : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_offset</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_ptr</span>:nativeint <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">stream</span>:<span><a href=\"../../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/index.html#type-stream_ref\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.stream_ref</a> option</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Ranged device-&gt;host copy out of this buffer, same contract.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-free\"><a href=\"#val-free\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> free : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Free the buffer</p></div></div>"}